    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Brendan Kearns, Hills Property, is delighted to present Annora's, Narin, Portnoo, Co. Donegal, to the market – a unique and well-established hospitality business with owner's accommodation in one of Ireland's most spectacular coastal locations.\r\n\r\nLocated just 200 metres from the stunning Blue Flag beach at Narin and Portnoo, along the world-famous Wild Atlantic Way, Annora's represents a rare opportunity to acquire a thriving multi-faceted hospitality premises in the heart of one of Donegal's most sought-after tourist destinations."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Ground Floor:\r\n\r\nBar & Lounge\r\nCafé/Restaurant Area\r\nCommercial Kitchens\r\nCovered Outdoor Bar\r\nOutdoor Seating Area\r\nCold Room\r\nStore\r\nOffice\r\nPublic Bathrooms\r\nGround Floor Bedroom\r\nHallways & Porches\r\n\r\nFirst Floor:\r\n\r\n8 Bedrooms\r\n4 En-Suites\r\n2 Shared Bathrooms\r\nLaundry Room\r\nStore Room\r\nBalcony\r\n\r\nTotal Accommodation\r\n\r\n9 Bedrooms (including ground-floor bedroom)\r\n6 Bathrooms (4 en-suites and 2 shared bathrooms on first floor)\r\nFull hospitality and catering facilities\r\nPrivate accommodation component\r\nExtensive indoor and outdoor customer areas"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "This substantial property comprises a well-known bar and lounge, café/restaurant and takeaway facilities, commercial kitchen, impressive outdoor entertainment space, guest accommodation and a private owner's residence. Combining lifestyle and business in one exceptional package, the property offers an outstanding opportunity for owner-operators, investors or hospitality entrepreneurs seeking an established business with significant future potential.\r\n\r\nNarin and Portnoo attract visitors throughout the year, drawn by the area's magnificent beaches, championship golf links, outdoor pursuits and breathtaking coastal scenery. Donegal Airport, located approximately 38km away, provides convenient regional connectivity and has earned international recognition for its spectacular setting.\r\n\r\nThe business enjoys a prominent position within the village and benefits from local support while also serving the substantial seasonal tourist market that visits the region. With multiple revenue streams and scope for further development, Annora's offers purchasers the opportunity to build upon a respected business in a location where hospitality and tourism continue to thrive.\r\n\r\nFrom the vibrant bar and welcoming dining areas to the extensive outdoor facilities and guest accommodation, every aspect of the property has been designed to cater for both residents and visitors alike. This is an exceptional opportunity to acquire a landmark business and residence in one of the most picturesque locations along Ireland's Atlantic coastline."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "BER Details",
        "SortOrder": 4,
        "Content": "BER: B3"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Viewing Details",
        "SortOrder": 6,
        "Content": "Viewing by appointment only.  For all enquiries, please contact Brendan at Hills Property on 085 1773362."
      }
